### GoPratle API — REST Client Sample Requests
### Uses VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### Set @baseUrl to your running backend before executing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Health
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# POST — Create Planner Requirement
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Create planner (single date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890

{
  "eventName": "Annual Corporate Gala",
  "eventType": "corporate_event",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-12-20",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "venue": "Taj Mahal Palace",
  "category": "planner",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 250,
    "budget": 500000,
    "currency": "INR",
    "servicesRequired": ["catering_coordination", "decoration_theme", "vendor_management"],
    "styleTheme": "Black Tie",
    "planningScope": "full_planning",
    "coordinationDays": 1,
    "preferredExperience": "experienced",
    "specialRequests": "Require a Jain-friendly catering option."
  }
}

###

### Create planner (date range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901

{
  "eventName": "Three-Day Wedding Celebration",
  "eventType": "wedding",
  "dateMode": "range",
  "startDate": "2026-12-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-17",
  "location": "Udaipur, Rajasthan",
  "venue": "City Palace",
  "category": "planner",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 500,
    "budget": 2000000,
    "currency": "INR",
    "servicesRequired": ["venue_selection", "decoration_theme", "catering_coordination", "guest_management"],
    "styleTheme": "Royal Rajasthani",
    "planningScope": "full_planning",
    "coordinationDays": 3,
    "preferredExperience": "experienced"
  }
}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# POST — Create Performer Requirement
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Create performer requirement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012

{
  "eventName": "College Farewell Night",
  "eventType": "college_fest",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-11-30",
  "location": "Pune",
  "venue": "MIT College Auditorium",
  "category": "performer",
  "details": {
    "performanceType": "live_band",
    "performerCount": 5,
    "durationMinutes": 90,
    "performanceCount": 1,
    "genre": "Bollywood / Indie Rock",
    "soundSystemRequired": true,
    "lightingRequired": true,
    "stageRequired": true,
    "equipmentRequirements": "Full backline provided by venue. Band brings own instruments.",
    "specialInstructions": "Must include 3 Hindi songs from 90s era.",
    "budgetMin": 50000,
    "budgetMax": 80000,
    "budgetCurrency": "INR"
  }
}

###

### Create performer — DJ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-defa-234567890123

{
  "eventName": "Birthday Bash",
  "eventType": "birthday",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-11-22",
  "location": "Delhi",
  "category": "performer",
  "details": {
    "performanceType": "dj",
    "performerCount": 1,
    "durationMinutes": 240,
    "performanceCount": 1,
    "genre": "House / EDM",
    "soundSystemRequired": true,
    "lightingRequired": false,
    "stageRequired": false,
    "budgetMin": 20000,
    "budgetMax": 35000,
    "budgetCurrency": "INR"
  }
}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# POST — Create Crew Requirement
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Create crew requirement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-efab-345678901234

{
  "eventName": "Tech Summit 2026",
  "eventType": "corporate_event",
  "dateMode": "range",
  "startDate": "2026-12-05",
  "endDate": "2026-12-06",
  "location": "Bengaluru",
  "venue": "BIEC Exhibition Centre",
  "category": "crew",
  "details": {
    "roles": ["sound_technician", "lighting_technician", "stagehand", "photographer", "videographer"],
    "crewCount": 15,
    "shiftHours": 10,
    "shiftCount": 2,
    "experienceLevel": "intermediate",
    "equipmentRequired": "Venue provides AV rack; crew brings personal tools.",
    "dressCode": "All black",
    "reportingInstructions": "Report to Stage Manager at Gate 3 by 07:00.",
    "specialRequests": "Fluent Hindi/English speakers preferred."
  }
}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# GET — List Requirements
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### List all (page 1, default limit 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements?category=planner
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements?page=2&limit=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Filter + paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements?category=performer&page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# GET — Single Requirement
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Get by ID (replace with a real _id from a POST response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements/000000000000000000000001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Malformed ID — expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements/not-a-valid-id
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Error cases
# ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Missing required field — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventType": "wedding",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-12-20",
  "location": "Chennai",
  "category": "planner",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 100,
    "servicesRequired": ["catering_coordination"],
    "planningScope": "full_planning",
    "coordinationDays": 1
  }
}

###

### Past date — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventName": "Old Event",
  "eventType": "birthday",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2020-01-01",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "category": "planner",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 50,
    "servicesRequired": ["catering_coordination"],
    "planningScope": "day_of_coordination",
    "coordinationDays": 1
  }
}

###

### Cross-category fields — expect 400 (planner details sent with performer category)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventName": "Mixed Up Event",
  "eventType": "concert",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-12-20",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "category": "performer",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 300,
    "servicesRequired": ["catering_coordination"],
    "planningScope": "full_planning",
    "coordinationDays": 1
  }
}

###

### Idempotency replay — same key, expect 200 (not 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requirements
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890

{
  "eventName": "Annual Corporate Gala",
  "eventType": "corporate_event",
  "dateMode": "single",
  "startDate": "2026-12-20",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "venue": "Taj Mahal Palace",
  "category": "planner",
  "details": {
    "guestCount": 250,
    "budget": 500000,
    "currency": "INR",
    "servicesRequired": ["catering_coordination"],
    "planningScope": "full_planning",
    "coordinationDays": 1
  }
}

###

### Unknown route — expect JSON 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

